    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "07488843045c747a79af": "Plucky doesn't want Tirth to know he's still in the Shimmering Flats, so he turned himself into a chicken!$B$BIf you find Plucky, beckon him to you.  Maybe he'll come out of hiding.",
        "37e513effbe6e1549c72": "Hello, $c!  Welcome to the races at the Shimmering Flats!",
        "3ff76a8bfd77da51fc18": "Welcome to the races!  Enjoy your stay, and don't bet all your money in one place!",
        "62a3c84f2d360736a4f7": "Who has the fastest car?  Who knows?!?",
        "f8b866b8f6bfb5ac743f": "The goblin racer packs a lot of punch, but the gnomes hid a trick or two in their car..."
      },
      "name": "Race Master Kronkrider",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
